tain servers to have previous stocks before all timers fully reset. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Directions\">Directions</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><video src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f3/ClassicAreaDriveLowestQual.mp4/revision/latest?cb=20250117013100\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; width: 720px; height: 480px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:ClassicAreaDriveLowestQual.mp4\">https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:ClassicAreaDriveLowestQual.mp4</a></video></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>This table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tools\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">Tools</a></big></span></h3>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table sortable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:12em\">Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6e/Gravity_Coil.png/revision/latest?cb=20230711193037\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gravity Coil\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gravity Coil.png\" data-image-key=\"Gravity_Coil.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6e/Gravity_Coil.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20230711193037\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$8,008\n</td>\n<td>Can be used to reach heights never seen before.\n</td><