ages/6/67/Classic_Billboard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/189?cb=20230711194418\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$1,270\n</td>\n<td>Wowzers! A brand new happy home for happy people? For only 50 tix!?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Team_Flag\" title=\"Team Flag\">Team Flag</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/95/Team_Flag_Boxed.png/revision/latest?cb=20240610055619\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Team Flag Boxed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"190\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Team Flag Boxed.png\" data-image-key=\"Team_Flag_Boxed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/95/Team_Flag_Boxed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20240610055619\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$3,000\n</td>\n<td>Allows you to play capture the flag, a fun way to challenge your enemies. Joining a flag team will forcefully enable PVP for you, allowing you to use any PVP weapons you desire. Take flags from enemy teams and return them back to yours to earn points! Make sure to buy more than one flag post.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vehicles\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Vehicles\" title=\"Category:Vehicles\">Vehicles</a></big></span></h3>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:12em\">Item\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Cost\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Joop\" title=\"Classic Joop\">Classic Joop</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/Classic_Joop_Boxed.png/revision/latest?cb=2